  "id": 203988899208310,
  "uuid": "fde92aab-3ed0-4415-8be6-4247c2a3b98a",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "27048e78-ffda-39b8-8e42-ed9927b53a2a",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "affa1e13-437c-24c6-da21-10df5d14f8b1",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I wanted to better myself as a leader,\" Anne explains. \"GSMC's world-class, holistic approach to media education offered exactly that.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "One of the most transformative aspects of the programme, she says, was the collaborative learning environment. \"Engaging with other media leaders from across East Africa was incredibly enriching.\" The relationships she built during the programme extended beyond the classroom. \"We still touch base and lift each other up in our respective roles. That support has been invaluable.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Balancing the demands of the programme with her professional and family life was no small feat. The academic load, particularly the research component, was intense. But Anne took it in stride. \"Sacrifice, commitment, and passion kept me going,\" she reflects. \"Beyond the theory, I discovered practical, innovative solutions to real-world challenges in the media industry.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Today, Anne leads with greater clarity, purpose, and confidence. She credits the programme with sharpening her strategic thinking and strengthening her decision-making through the use of data and evidence. \"I now approach problems with a mindset focused on impact. From audience growth to revenue strategies, I see tangible results in our work.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Looking ahead, Anne envisions herself as a pioneer in the children's edutainment space and as a mentor to the next generation of media professionals. She remains committed to advancing high-quality, educational content for young audiences across Africa.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"GSMC transformed me,\" she says. \"It gave me the mindset, networks, and tools to lead boldly in a rapidly evolving media landscape.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To those considering the EMMLI programme, Anne has clear advice. \"You're not just signing up for a degree. You're stepping into a transformative journey that will challenge, inspire, and empower you.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
